Logitech controller for the ROV 
foreaft	Drives the ROV forward and backward, using the left stick's y-axis	3	SLIDER	Y Axis	0	1.0	0.0
strafe	Makes the ROV strafe left and right using the left stick's x-axis	3	SLIDER	X Axis	0	1.0	0.0
lift	Drives the ROV up and down using the right stick's y-axis	3	SLIDER	Z Rotation	0	1.0	0.0
turn	Turns the ROV left and right using the right stick's x-axis	3	SLIDER	Z Axis	0	1.0	0.0
vslow	Makes the vertical motion slow down to 50% speed, using the pressed right stick	1	BUTTON	Button 11	0	0.0	0.0
lslow	Makes the lateral movement slower by pressing the left stick	1	BUTTON	Button 10	0	0.0	0.0
safore	Moves the sidearm forward with RT	1	BUTTON	Button 7	0	0.0	0.0
saback	Moves the sidearm backward with RB	1	BUTTON	Button 5	0	0.0	0.0
mainleft	rotates the main claw left with LT	1	BUTTON	Button 6	0	0.0	0.0
mainright	rotates the main claw right with LB	1	BUTTON	Button 4	0	0.0	0.0
camup	moves the camera up using up on the dpad. hat val 2	2	HAT	cooliehat: Hat Switch	0	1.0	0.0
main	Actuates the main manipulator claw with A	1	BUTTON	Button 1	0	0.0	0.0
side	actuates the side manipulator with B	1	BUTTON	Button 2	0	0.0	0.0
maintipfore	tips the main claw foreward with Y	1	BUTTON	Button 3	0	0.0	0.0
maintipaft	tips the main claw backward with X	1	BUTTON	Button 0	0	0.0	0.0
